atterned</a>, <a href="/admission-requirements-international-high-school-students#anchor-cape">CAPE</a></p></div> </section></div></li><li class="m-accordion-item-wrapper"><div class="m-accordion-item js-accordion-item " data-accordion-state="collapsed" data-accordion-component="item"><div class="m-accordion-item__header-wrapper"><h3 class="a-heading__h4 a-heading__accordion a-heading--margin-reset"> <button class="m-accordion-item__label toggle js-accordion-item__toggle" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="" > Argentina <svg class="accordion-item__toggle-plus a-icon--small" aria-hidden="true" > <use xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink" xlink:href="/themes/utfs/dist/icons.svg#plus-solid"></use> </svg> <svg class="accordion-item__toggle-minus a-icon--small" aria-hidden="true" > <use xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink" xlink:href="/themes/utfs/dist/icons.svg#minus-solid"></use> </svg> </button></h3></div> <section class="m-accordion-item__content s-wysiwyg js-accordion-item__panel" data-accordion-component="content" aria-hidden=true aria-labelledby="" id="" ><div class="s-wysiwyg"><p><strong>Minimum Admission Requirements:</strong></p><p>Bachillerato</p></div> </section></div></li><li class="m-accordion-item-wrapper"><div class="m-accordion-item js-accordion-item " data-accordion-state="collapsed" data-accordion-component="item"><div class="m-accordion-item__header-wrapper"><h3 class="a-heading__h4 a-heading__accordion a-heading--margin-reset"> <button class="m-accordion-item__label toggle js-accordion-item__toggle" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="" > Armenia <svg class="accordion-item__toggle-plus a-icon--small" aria-hidden="true" > <use xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink" xlink:href="/themes/utfs/dist/icons.svg#plus-solid"></use> </svg> <svg class="accordion-item__toggle-minus a-icon--small" aria-hidden="true" > <use xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink" xlink:href="/themes/utfs/dist/icons.svg#minus-solid"></use> </svg> </button></h3></div> <section class="m-accordion-item__content s-wysiwyg js-accordion-item__panel" data-accordion-component="content" aria-hidden=true aria-labelledby="" id="" ><div class="s-wysiwyg"><p><strong>Minimum Admissions Requirement:&nbsp;</strong></p><p>Certificate of Complete General Secondary Education</p></div> </section></div></li><li class="m-accordion-item-wrapper"><div class="m-accordion-item js-accordion-item " data-accordion-state="collapsed" data-accordion-component="item"><div class="m-accordion-item__header-wrapper"><h3 class="a-heading__h4 a-heading__accordion a-heading--margin-reset"> <button class="m-accordion-item__label toggle js-accordion-item__toggle" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="" > Australia <svg class="accordion-item__toggle-plus a-icon--small" aria-hidden="true" > <use xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink" xlink:href="/themes/utfs/dist/icons.svg#plus-solid"></use> </svg> <svg class="accordion-item__toggle-minus a-icon--small" aria-hidden="true" > <use xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink" xlink:href="/themes/utfs/dist/icons.svg#minus-solid"></use> </svg> </button></h3></div> <section class="m-accordion-item__content s-wysiwyg js-accordion-item__panel" data-accordion-component="content" aria-hidden=true aria-labelledby="" id="" ><div class="s-wysiwyg"><p><strong>Minimum Admission Requirements:</strong></p><ul><li>ACT: Senior Secondary Certificate and ATAR (Australian Tertiary Admission Rank)</li><li>NSW: Higher School Certificate and ATAR</li><li>NT: Certificate of Education and ATAR</li><li>QLD: Certificate of Education and ATAR</li><li>SA: Certificate of Education and ATAR</li><li>TAS: Certificate of Education and ATAR</li><li>VIC: Certificate of Education and ATAR</li><li>WA: Certificate of Education and ATAR</li></ul></div> </section></div></li><li class="m-accordion-item-wrapper"><div class="m-accordion-item js-accordion-item " data-accordion-state="collapsed" data-accordion-component="item"><div class="m-accordion-item__header-wrapper"><h3 class="a-heading__h4 a-heading__accordion a-heading--margin-reset"> <button class="m-accordion-item__label toggle js-accordion-item__toggle" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="" > Austria <svg class="accordion-item__toggle-plus a-icon--small" aria-hidden="true" > <use xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink" xlink:href="/themes/utfs/dist/icons.svg#plus-solid"></use> </svg> <svg class="accordion-item__toggle-minus a-icon--small" aria-hidden="true" > <use xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink" xlink:href="/themes/utfs/dist/icons.svg#minus-solid"></use> </svg> </button></h3></div> <section class="m-accordion-item__content s-wysiwyg js-accordion-item__panel" data-accordion-component="content" aria-hidden=true aria-labelledby="" id="" ><div class="s-wysiwyg"><p><strong>Minimum Admission Requirements:</strong></p><p>Reifeprufungzeugnis (“Matura”)/Reifezeugnis</p></div> </section></div></li><li class="m-accordion-item-wrapper"><div class="m-accordion-item js-accordion-item " data-accordion-state="collapsed" data-accordion-component="item"><div class="m-accordion-item__header-wrapper"><h3 class="a-heading__h4 a-heading__accordion a-heading--margin-reset"> <button class="m-accordion-item__label toggle js-accordion-item__toggle" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="" > Azerbaijan <svg class="accordion-item__toggle-plus a-icon--small" aria-hidden="true" > <use xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink" xlink:href="/themes/utfs/dist/icons.svg#plus-solid"></use> </svg> <svg class="accordion-item__toggle-minus a-icon--small" aria-hidden="true" > <use xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink" xlink:href="/themes/utfs/dist/icons.svg#minus-solid"></use> </svg> </button></h3></div> <section class="m-accordion-item__content s-wysiwyg js-accordion-item__panel" data-accordion-component="content" aria-hidden=true aria-labelledby="" id="" ><div class="s-wysiwyg"><p><strong>Minimum Admission Requirements:</strong></p><p>Certificate of Complete Secondary Education (Tam Orta Təhsil Haqqında Attestat)</p></div> </section></div></li><li class="m-accordion-item-wrapper"><div class="m-accordion-item js-accordion-item " data-accordion-state="collapsed" data-accordion-component="item"><div class="m-accordion-item__header-wrapper"><h3 class="a-heading__h4 a-heading__accordion a-heading--margin-reset"> <button class="m-accordion-item__label toggle js-accordion-item__toggle" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="" > Bahamas <svg class="accordion-item__toggle-plus a-icon--small" aria-hidden="true" > <use xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink" xlink:href="/themes/utfs/dist/icons.svg#plus-solid"></use> </svg> <svg class="accordion-item__toggle-minus a-icon--small" aria-hidden="true" > <use xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink" xlink:href="/themes/utfs/dist/icons.svg#minus-solid"></use> </svg> </button></h3></div> <section class="m-accordion-item__content s-wysiwyg js-accordion-item__panel" data-accordion-component="content" aria-hidden=true aria-labelledby="" id="" ><div class="s-wysiwyg"><p><strong>Minimum Admission Requirements:</strong></p><p>High School (Grade 12) Diploma with IGCSE/BGCSE and SAT Reasoning/ACT/AP examinations or First Year completed at the University of the Bahamas.</p><p>See <a href="/admission-requirements-international-high-school-students#anchor-british-patterned">British-Patterned</a>, <a href="/admission-requirements-international-high-school-students#anchor-international-baccalaureate">International Baccalaureate</a></p></div> </section></div></li><li class="m-accordion-item-wrapper"><div class="m-accordion-item js-accordion-item " data-accordion-state="collapsed" data-accordion-component="item"><div class="m-accordion-item__header-wrapper"><h3 class="a-heading__h4 a-heading__accordion a-heading--margin-reset"> <button class="m-accordion-item__label toggle js-accordion-item__toggle" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="" > Bahrain <svg class="accordion-item__toggle-plus a-icon--small" aria-hidden="true" > <use xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink" xlink:href="/themes/utfs/dist/icons.svg#plus-solid"></use> </svg> <svg class="accordion-item__toggle-minus a-icon--small" aria-hidden="true" > <use xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink" xlink:href="/themes/utfs/dist/icons.svg#minus-solid"></use> </svg> </button></h3></div> <section class="m-accordion-item__content s-wysiwyg js-accordion-item__panel" data-accordion-component="content" aria-hidden=true aria-labelledby="" id="" ><div class="s-wysiwyg"><p><strong>Minimum Admission Requirements:</strong></p><p>Secondary school education/leaving certificate</p></div> </section></div></li><li class="m-accordion-item-wrapper"><div class="m-accordion-item js-accordion-item " data-accordion-state="collapsed" data-accordion-component="item"><div class="m-accordion-item__header-wrapper"><h3 class="a-heading__h4 a-heading__accordion a-heading--margin-reset"> <button class="m-accordion-item__label toggle js-accordion-item__toggle" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="" > Bangladesh <svg class="accordion-item__toggle-plus a-icon--small" aria-hidden="true" > <use xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink" xlink:href="/themes/utfs/dist/icons.svg#plus-solid"></use> </svg> <svg class="accordion-item__toggle-minus a-icon--small" aria-hidden="true" > <use xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink" xlink:href="/themes/utfs/dist/icons.svg#minus-solid"></use> </svg> </button></h3></div> <section class="m-accordion-item__content s-wysiwyg js-accordion-item__panel" data-accordion-component="content" aria-hidden=true aria-labelledby="" id="" ><div class="s-wysiwyg"><p><strong>Minimum Admission Requirements:</strong></p><p>Higher Secondary Certificate</p></div> </section></div></li><li class="m-accordion-item-wrapper"><div class="m-accordion-item js-accordion-item " data-accordion-state="collapsed" data-accordion-component="item"><div class="m-accordion-item__header-wrapper"><h3 class="a-heading__h4 a-heading__accordion a-heading--margin-re