el" data-accordion-component="content" aria-hidden=true aria-labelledby="" id="" ><div class="s-wysiwyg"><p><strong>Minimum Admission Requirements:</strong></p><p>Bhutan Higher Secondary Education Certificate</p></div> </section></div></li><li class="m-accordion-item-wrapper"><div class="m-accordion-item js-accordion-item " data-accordion-state="collapsed" data-accordion-component="item"><div class="m-accordion-item__header-wrapper"><h3 class="a-heading__h4 a-heading__accordion a-heading--margin-reset"> <button class="m-accordion-item__label toggle js-accordion-item__toggle" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="" > Bolivia <svg class="accordion-item__toggle-plus a-icon--small" aria-hidden="true" > <use xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink" xlink:href="/themes/utfs/dist/icons.svg#plus-solid"></use> </svg> <svg class="accordion-item__toggle-minus a-icon--small" aria-hidden="true" > <use xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink" xlink:href="/themes/utfs/dist/icons.svg#minus-solid"></use> </svg> </button></h3></div> <section class="m-accordion-item__content s-wysiwyg js-accordion-item__panel" data-accordion-component="content" aria-hidden=true aria-labelledby="" id="" ><div class="s-wysiwyg"><p><strong>Minimum Admission Requirements:</strong></p><p>Bachillerato/Bachiller + University Entrance Exam (if written)</p></div> </section></div></li><li class="m-accordion-item-wrapper"><div class="m-accordion-item js-accordion-item " data-accordion-state="collapsed" data-accordion-component="item"><div class="m-accordion-item__header-wrapper"><h3 class="a-heading__h4 a-heading__accordion a-heading--margin-reset"> <button class="m-accordion-item__label toggle js-accordion-item__toggle" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="" > Bosnia and Herzegovina <svg class="accordion-item__toggle-plus a-icon--small" aria-hidden="true" > <use xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink" xlink:href="/themes/utfs/dist/icons.svg#plus-solid"></use> </svg> <svg class="accordion-item__toggle-minu